Package: scrutiny
Version: 0.10.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Disk health dashboard for S.M.A.R.T. metrics (Scrutiny)
 Scrutiny watches the health of every disk in the TNAS: collects S.M.A.R.T.
 attributes daily (scrutiny-collector timer), stores the full history in
 SQLite and shows failure-risk dashboards at http://<NAS>:18232 in a new
 browser tab. Requires the smartctl binary for S.M.A.R.T. collection
 (present on stock TOS; checked at install).
 Upstream project: https://github.com/AnalogJ/scrutiny (MIT), packaged
 unmodified.
